---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_supplied: not paused
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_claimed: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supply: tokens not supplied
    q_revert_supply --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_sig: position.hasSettled == false
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_verify_sig --> q_calc_alloc: verify dual signature (Legion signer authorization)
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_calc_alloc --> q_check_vesting: calculate allocation from cachedTokenAllocationRate * investedCapital
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: has vesting schedule
    q_check_vesting --> q_transfer_immediate: no vesting
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer: deploy LegionLinearVesting clone, transfer vested tokens
    q_transfer --> q_finalize: transfer immediate portion
    q_transfer_immediate --> q_finalize: transfer full allocation
    q_finalize --> [*]: position.hasSettled = true, emit TokensClaimed

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: dual signature verification (not Merkle proof) for pre-liquid approved
        INV-002: allocation = cachedTokenAllocationRate * acceptedCapital
        INV-003: each investor can claim exactly once
        INV-004: vesting contract deployed via EIP-1167 minimal proxy if needed
    end note
